The status code's first digit (integer division by 100) identifies the class:

| Range | Bucket |
|-------|--------|
| 100–199 | `info` |
| 200–299 | `success` |
| 300–399 | `redirect` |
| 400–499 | `client-error` |
| 500–599 | `server-error` |

Anything outside 100–599 throws a `RangeError`; non-integer or non-number input throws a `TypeError`.

